# 4. Copy .env.example to .env.local and fill in actual values

# Alternative Email Services (uncomment and modify if needed)
# EMAIL_USER=your-email@outlook.com
# EMAIL_PASS=your-password
# EMAIL_SERVICE=outlook

# For production deployment, set these in your hosting platform's environment variables
# Vercel: Project Settings > Environment Variables
# Netlify: Site settings > Build & deploy > Environment
# AWS: Elastic Beanstalk > Configuration > Environment properties
